---
import DirectionLayout from '../../../layouts/DirectionLayout.astro';
---
<DirectionLayout title="實作型教練｜助人服務方向 09" description="為擅長拆解問題、偏好清楚行動的教練與顧問設計的高對比首頁。">
  <main id="main" class="ma-site">
    <header class="ma-header"><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'layouts/'} class="ma-brand">MAKE<br /><span>A MOVE</span><small>COACHING / 09</small></a><nav><a href="#method">我的方法</a><a href="#work">合作方式</a><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'layouts/'}>其他人格設計 ↗</a></nav><a href="#work" class="ma-nav-cta">先說說卡在哪裡 ↗</a></header>
    <section class="ma-cover"><div class="ma-cover-label"><span>FIELD GUIDE FOR YOUR NEXT MOVE</span><span>NO. 09 / 2026</span></div><h1>卡住的事，<br /><i>拆成下一步。</i></h1><div class="ma-cover-bottom"><p>給有很多想法，卻還不知道從哪裡動手的人。先看清問題，再一起挑一個可以開始的動作。</p><a href="#method">看方法如何運作 <b>↓</b></a></div><figure><img src="https://tenwebs-6qkx6x5p.manus.space/images/directions/c-coach.webp" alt="工作桌上的藍色資料夾、橘色卡片與行動筆記" /><figcaption>MAKE THE NEXT MOVE / VISUAL STUDY</figcaption></figure><span class="ma-arrow-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></section>
    <section class="ma-problem"><div><p class="ma-kicker">START WITH THE REAL PROBLEM</p><h2>不是你不夠努力。<br />可能只是下一步還不夠清楚。</h2></div><div><p>教練式合作不替你做決定，也不保證結果。它提供一個拆解目標、檢視選項、回到行動的結構。</p><span class="ma-caveat">以下內容為版型示範，請由專業者填入真實服務範圍與方法。</span></div></section>
    <section class="ma-method" id="method"><div class="ma-method-head"><p class="ma-kicker">THE 3-MOVE METHOD</p><h2>把「不知道」<br />變成可以做的事。</h2></div><div class="ma-steps"><details class="ma-step ma-step--one" open><summary><span>MOVE / 01</span><h3>說清楚</h3><b>01</b></summary><p>把模糊的卡點變成一個可以共同工作的問題。</p></details><details class="ma-step ma-step--two"><summary><span>MOVE / 02</span><h3>看選項</h3><b>02</b></summary><p>整理限制、資源與可行路徑，不急著替你選。</p></details><details class="ma-step ma-step--three"><summary><span>MOVE / 03</span><h3>試一步</h3><b>03</b></summary><p>選一個可檢視的小行動，帶著觀察回到下一次。</p></details></div></section>
    <section class="ma-work" id="work"><div class="ma-work-title"><p class="ma-kicker">HOW WE COULD WORK</p><h2>合作方式，<br /><i>先透明再開始。</i></h2></div><div class="ma-work-body"><article><span>01 / 個人教練</span><p>適合想拆解一個明確目標或工作情境的人。時間與費用待站長填入。</p></article><article><span>02 / 團隊工作坊</span><p>依團隊問題設計練習與討論，先確認人數、範圍、時間與交付項目。</p></article><article><span>03 / 初次對談</span><p>先核對彼此期待與服務範圍，再決定是否適合繼續。</p></article><a class="ma-contact" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'layouts/'}>查看另外九種網站方向 ↗</a></div></section>
    <section class="ma-bottom"><p>不需要一次把整條路看完。</p><h2>先找到<br />下一個動作。</h2><span>設計原型 · CTA 尚未連接預約</span></section>
    <footer class="ma-footer"><span>MAKE A MOVE / 教練與顧問服務示意</span><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'layouts/'}>返回十款設計比較</a><span>清楚，不等於催促。</span></footer>
  </main>
</DirectionLayout>
<style>
.ma-site{--ma-ink:#151d38;--ma-blue:#2148d8;--ma-orange:#ee6846;--ma-paper:#f1eadb;min-height:100vh;background:var(--ma-paper);color:var(--ma-ink);padding:0 clamp(1rem,4vw,4rem) 2rem;font-family:Arial,"Noto Sans TC",sans-serif}.ma-header{height:88px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ma-ink);gap:1rem}.ma-brand{text-decoration:none;font-size:.75rem;line-height:.83;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.04em}.ma-brand span{color:var(--ma-blue)}.ma-brand small{display:block;font: .5rem ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-top:.4rem}.ma-header nav{display:flex;gap:1.4rem;font-size:.69rem;font-weight:700}.ma-header nav a{text-decoration:none}.ma-nav-cta{background:var(--ma-blue);color:white;padding:.7rem .9rem;text-decoration:none;font-size:.65rem;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--ma-orange)}.ma-cover{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;min-height:650px;padding:2rem 0 5rem;overflow:hidden}.ma-cover-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font: .57rem ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#5e6880}.ma-cover h1{position:relative;z-index:2;font-size:clamp(5rem,12vw,11rem);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.11em;margin:4rem 0 1rem}.ma-cover h1 i{font-style:normal;color:var(--ma-blue)}.ma-cover-bottom{position:relative;z-index:2;margin-left:8vw;display:flex;align-items:end;gap:3rem}.ma-cover-bottom p{max-width:360px;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.8}.ma-cover-bottom a{font: .65rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--ma-blue);border-bottom:2px solid var(--ma-orange);padding-bottom:.4rem;text-decoration:none}.ma-cover-bottom b{margin-left:1rem}.ma-cover figure{position:absolute;right:1%;top:16%;width:34%;margin:0;transform:rotate(3deg)}.ma-cover figure img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid var(--ma-ink);box-shadow:12px 12px 0 var(--ma-orange)}.ma-cover figcaption{font: .52rem ui-monospace,monospace;margin-top:.65rem}.ma-arrow-mark{position:absolute;right:37%;bottom:10%;font-size:3.5rem;color:var(--ma-orange);transform:rotate(18deg)}.ma-kicker{font: .61rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--ma-blue);letter-spacing:.13em}.ma-problem{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto 6rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:6vw;border-top:2px solid var(--ma-ink);border-bottom:2px solid var(--ma-ink);padding:1.5rem 0 2rem}.ma-problem h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,4.8rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:.5rem 0}.ma-problem>div:last-child{align-self:end}.ma-problem>div:last-child>p{font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.9;max-width:470px}.ma-caveat{font: .58rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:#4e5975}.ma-method{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto 6rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.72fr 1.28fr;gap:5vw}.ma-method-head h2,.ma-work-title h2{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5vw,5.2rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:.7rem 0}.ma-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.8rem;align-items:start}.ma-step{position:relative;min-height:260px;padding:1rem;background:#d8deee;border-top:8px solid var(--ma-blue)}.ma-step--two{margin-top:2rem;background:#f7c7a6;border-color:var(--ma-orange)}.ma-step--three{margin-top:4rem;background:#d7dfb9;border-color:#7f923b}.ma-step>summary{position:relative;display:block;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}.ma-step>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ma-step>summary::marker{content:""}.ma-step>summary>span{font: .58rem ui-monospace,monospace}.ma-step summary h3{font-size:1.75rem;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:2rem 0 .5rem}.ma-step p{font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.7;max-width:220px}.ma-step>summary>b{position:absolute;right:.7rem;bottom:.4rem;font-size:3rem;letter-spacing:-.1em;opacity:.2}.ma-step>summary::after{content:"＋";position:absolute;right:0;top:0;font: .8rem ui-monospace,monospace}.ma-step[open]>summary::after{content:"−"}.ma-work{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto 6rem;background:var(--ma-ink);color:white;padding:clamp(1.3rem,4vw,3.5rem);display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;gap:6vw}.ma-work .ma-kicker{color:#9eb1ff}.ma-work-title h2 i{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;color:#ff9d77}.ma-work-body article{border-top:1px solid #ffffff45;padding:.8rem 0}.ma-work-body article span{font: .59rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:#ffad8c}.ma-work-body article p{font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.7;color:#d6d9e4;margin:.35rem 0}.ma-contact{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.2rem;color:#a6b8ff;font-size:.7rem}.ma-bottom{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto 3rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr auto;align-items:end;gap:2rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ma-ink);padding-bottom:1.5rem}.ma-bottom>p{font-size:.8rem}.ma-bottom h2{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,7vw,6rem);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.1em;color:var(--ma-blue);margin:0}.ma-bottom span{font: .55rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:#4e5975}.ma-footer{border-top:1px solid #bdb5a7;padding:1rem 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;font: .57rem ui-monospace,monospace;color:#4e5975}.ma-footer a{color:var(--ma-blue)}@media(max-width:850px){.ma-header{height:auto;padding:1rem 0;flex-wrap:wrap}.ma-header nav{order:3;width:100%;justify-content:space-between}.ma-cover{min-height:0;padding:2rem 0 4rem}.ma-cover h1{font-size:13vw;margin:3rem 0 1rem}.ma-cover figure{top:24%;width:38%}.ma-cover-bottom{margin-left:1rem}.ma-method{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.ma-work{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.ma-bottom{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.ma-bottom span{grid-column:2}}@media(max-width:560px){.ma-header nav{font-size:.6rem;gap:.5rem}.ma-nav-cta{font-size:.56rem}.ma-cover-label{font-size:.49rem}.ma-cover h1{font-size:16vw;margin:3rem 0 1rem}.ma-cover figure{position:relative;top:auto;right:auto;width:76%;margin:2rem 0 0 auto}.ma-cover-bottom{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:.5rem}.ma-arrow-mark{right:10%;bottom:15%;font-size:2rem}.ma-problem{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.5rem}.ma-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ma-step,.ma-step--two,.ma-step--three{margin:0;min-height:190px}.ma-step h3{margin:1rem 0 .4rem}.ma-bottom{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ma-bottom span{grid-column:auto}.ma-footer{flex-direction:column}}
</style>